// EXPECT-ERROR: 64 does not fit in intensity, which is u8 <= 63 - a cast checks a constant rather than clamping it
// EXPECT-AT: 8:9
// A cast of a runtime value emits nothing and checks nothing; a cast of a
// constant is a constant landing in the unit, and clamping it would be a cost
// nobody wrote (§75).
unit intensity = u8 <= 63
intensity level
level = intensity( 64 )
